ss=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">February 24, 2021</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #14</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_16\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 16\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #16</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #15</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on February 24, 2021 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the fifteenth issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, the final issue of the five-part <i><a href=\"/wiki/A_Game_of_Nowhere_(comic_arc)\" title=\"A Game of Nowhere (comic arc)\">A Game of Nowhere</a></i> arc, and the final issue of the fifteen-part <i>Archer's Peak</i> saga.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a> needs a scapegoat to hide the existence of monsters from the world. <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a>'s actions will determine what is to become of Archer's Peak, and ultimately, the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p>Erica kills the last of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Oscuratypes</span>, then walks into the house and douses her head in cold water. She tells <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a> to bring her her backpack. She calls the House, and tells them to tell the <a href=\"/wiki/White_Mask\" title=\"White Mask\">White Masks</a> that the brood are dead, and it's time to go home. She then asks James if she can use his shower.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia</a> gets the call, and then enters the gym and tells <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine</a> to stand down. She tells <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Joe Cavanaugh</a> to arrest Tommy, and make sure everyone understands the cover story. She tells <a href=\"/wiki/John_Collins\" title=\"John Collins\">Principal Collins</a> that the school will receive a donation to cover repairs, in exchange for him never reporting the damage. She then reprimands Maxine for barging into the school with weapons, and declares that this is over.\n</p><p>One week later, a news reporter describes the killings as murders by <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a>, including Officer <a href=\"/wiki/John_Richards\" title=\"John Richards\">John Richards</a>, and that his arraignment will be next week. Ms. Mahoney cries over her daughter's grave. Erica watches the missing posters be taken down at the bus station. <a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">The Old Dragon</a> meets here there, and asks if she remembers when she attempted to run away to DisneyWorld. Jessica came to get her, and told her that while the Order was \"old and stodgy and stuck in its ways,\" without it, children would die, and nobody would know why. Erica insists that she will refuse to care less, that if she had followed orders, more people would have died and nobody would have had closure.\n</p><p>The Dragon asks her to come home as the last <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mask\" title=\"Black Mask\">Black Mask</a> in the House of Slaughter, and take Jessica's place in the Council, change it from the inside. She refuses, saying she renounces the House of Slaughter and will hunt monsters as a renegade. On the bus, she meets with <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a>. He assures her that he's not coming with her, but that he's going to Milwaukee to stay with his mother for a bit. He also tells her that Bian's family can't be found, and she's been adopted by <a href=\"/wiki/Gail\" title=\"Gail\">Gail</a>. She says she knows, and that she's been watching the kids to make sure there weren't loose ends. James then thanks her for letting him help, and hugs her as the bus drives off.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">The Old Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Archer.27s_Peak\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Archer's_Peak\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/John_Collins\" title=\"John Collins\">Principal John Collins</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gail\" title=\"Gail\">Gail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mr._Mahoney\" title=\"Mr. Mahoney\">Mr. Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tam\" title=\"Tam\">Tam</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">Monsters</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Totems\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Totems\">Totems</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratypes</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span> †</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae074dcbd9bc6c2b299e65e2ac2c391f\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"